---
title: What 647,795 application forms actually ask
date: 2026-09-09
summary: We keep a copy of the application form behind every posting we crawl. Counting them answers a question the advice articles skip — not how to beat the ATS, but how much it asks of you, and how much that depends on which one your employer bought.
type: article
tags:
  - ats
